/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/person\/87e55a5e8ea020a6e620192589a05abf","name":"KrakenFX","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","url":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","contentUrl":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","caption":"KrakenFX"},"url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/author\/alex-hatch"}]}},"jetpack_likes_enabled":false,"jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/peDd1v-6ma","jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/blog-Genesis.jpg?fit=1536%2C701&ssl=1","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/24438","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089386"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=24438"}],"version-history":[{"count":8,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/24438\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":24480,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/24438\/revisions\/24480"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/21124"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=24438"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=24438"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=24438"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=24438"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":24446,"date":"2024-02-13T08:51:57","date_gmt":"2024-02-13T13:51:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=24446"},"modified":"2025-03-17T16:39:28","modified_gmt":"2025-03-17T20:39:28","slug":"rise-through-the-ranks-with-our-new-futures-leaderboard","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/kraken-derivatives\/rise-through-the-ranks-with-our-new-futures-leaderboard","title":{"rendered":"Rise through the ranks with our new Futures Leaderboard"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-will-you-claim-a-top-50-position-on-our-futures-leaderboard\"><strong>Will you claim a top 50 position on our Futures Leaderboard?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our Futures Leaderboard now ranks the top 50 traders by realized and unrealized profit and loss (PnL), revealing the most successful futures traders over the last 7 days. Your rank, which you can share, evidences your strategy, skill and trading success. You can now find the leaderboard on both Kraken Pro web and the Kraken Pro app.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-social-media-ready-proof-of-your-trading-superiority\"><strong>Social-media-ready proof of your trading superiority<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether your gains are from going long or selling short, everyone can ascend the Leaderboard by executing and optimizing a winning strategy.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Prove your Futures Leaderboard rank on social media with our shareable Performance Card and let others know how you\u2019re nailing it in the market:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/lh7-us.googleusercontent.com\/Q6fXcavi6CUA5AECBXXZ6qZX6hUFohUm25Q28q61xPru9WXc9jQM1RXByuSwbUmH6UCbat8lIBgK8S5aao2WsEzks1HFrKvfRmVrVUAWq97VFAYg0IJfN2tQYBJa2_yR-G_n0EJ6T0nDrq2zzF-gfWU\" alt=\"\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether your gains are from going long or selling short, everyone can ascend the Leaderboard by executing and optimizing a winning strategy.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your Leaderboard ranking is determined by your realized and unrealized PnL (in USD) over a 7-day rolling calculation period. Your ranking refreshes on an ongoing basis to provide you with near-real-time rankings of all traders in our futures market.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/promos\/leaderboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Visit the Futures Leaderboard<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-let-s-get-started\"><strong>Let\u2019s get started<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Want to get your (nick)name on our Futures Leaderboard? If you are in an <a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/360023786632-Kraken-Futures-eligibility\">eligible region<\/a>, you can enable futures trading on your Kraken Pro account.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To start trading futures and be eligible to appear on the Leaderboard:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/sign-up?rfr=pro-web\">Open an account<\/a> or sign in to Kraken Pro<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Navigate to a perpetual futures market<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Accept the <a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/leaderboard\">terms and conditions<\/a>*<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/sign-up?rfr=pro-web&#038;type=personal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Create an account in minutes<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-explore-the-leaderboard\"><strong>Explore the Leaderboard<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Find the leaderboard at <a href=\"http:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/leaderboard\">pro.kraken.com\/app\/leaderboard<\/a> or click the trophy icon on the top right menu bar in Kraken Pro:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-videopress\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe title=\"VideoPress Video Player\" aria-label='VideoPress Video Player' width='500' height='273' src='https:\/\/videopress.com\/embed\/SznJEzHk?cover=1&amp;playsinline=1&amp;preloadContent=metadata&amp;useAverageColor=1&amp;hd=0' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen data-resize-to-parent=\"true\" allow='clipboard-write'><\/iframe><script src='https:\/\/v0.wordpress.com\/js\/next\/videopress-iframe.js?m=1739540970'><\/script>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At the top, you\u2019ll see a summary of your performance for the last seven days. This includes your overall rank, nickname and your PnL.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/lh7-us.googleusercontent.com\/X3zJ0Edc3ceaKmKNAx11bcdKP5Qp64JhJSjC09S6R718fKJbr85FTXAEpbBepmAh_Sev44_cy5IuJHzNtdpk3pLCwvxcMOavGAT7G1Crg51lriqGMncl8ZKnG7sbAxIDKYSYyXOPcGWTfbKV1q_UEi8\" alt=\"\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If your PnL% is in the top 50 of futures traders, you\u2019ll appear on the Leaderboard:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"579\" data-attachment-id=\"24456\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/kraken-derivatives\/rise-through-the-ranks-with-our-new-futures-leaderboard\/attachment\/screenshot-2024-02-13-at-7-17-41-am\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/Screenshot-2024-02-13-at-7.17.41%E2%80%AFAM.png?fit=1510%2C854&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1510,854\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Screenshot-2024-02-13-at-7.17.41\u202fAM\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/Screenshot-2024-02-13-at-7.17.41%E2%80%AFAM.png?fit=1024%2C579&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/Screenshot-2024-02-13-at-7.17.41%E2%80%AFAM.png?resize=1024%2C579&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24456\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/Screenshot-2024-02-13-at-7.17.41%E2%80%AFAM.png?resize=1024%2C579&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/Screenshot-2024-02-13-at-7.17.41%E2%80%AFAM.png?resize=300%2C170&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/Screenshot-2024-02-13-at-7.17.41%E2%80%AFAM.png?resize=768%2C434&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/Screenshot-2024-02-13-at-7.17.41%E2%80%AFAM.png?resize=1200%2C679&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/Screenshot-2024-02-13-at-7.17.41%E2%80%AFAM.png?resize=177%2C100&amp;ssl=1 177w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/Screenshot-2024-02-13-at-7.17.41%E2%80%AFAM.png?w=1510&amp;ssl=1 1510w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your nickname is solely for display purposes on the Leaderboard, so you have the option to remain anonymous. But feel free to personalize your nickname as you wish and share it for kudos!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/lh7-us.googleusercontent.com\/cmbmPU2AOrqYsx2y_jKoHuNd7-HibFzvz2uz_v_ecDHg831r1brIIYAuDqqDxck_m_XrTni-TlvYomTMjaUn7c04OdDv6oZK6yRpmUeu0Q0N_C8UW1OOnMTikibdbqNskDnjC9cNAOf0Csa_dpK0y8U\" alt=\"\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-who-is-eligible-for-the-leaderboard\"><strong>Who is eligible for the Leaderboard?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Both new and existing clients trading futures on Kraken will appear on the Leaderboard if they are in the top 50 of all traders over the last 7 days. However, to trade futures:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>You have to be in an <a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/360023786632-Kraken-Futures-eligibility\">eligible country<\/a>**<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Your Kraken account must be verified at Intermediate or Pro<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Visit the Futures Leaderboard and start climbing to claim your position among the top futures traders out there.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">*For more details on terms and conditions, visit our <a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/15478742641300-Futures-Trading-Competitions-Terms-Conditions\">Support Article<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">** Additional geo restrictions may apply.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/promos\/leaderboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Visit the Futures Leaderboard<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>These materials are for general information purposes only and are not investment advice or a recommendation or solicitation to buy, sell, stake or hold any cryptoasset or to engage in any specific trading strategy. Kraken does not and will not work to increase or decrease the price of any particular cryptoasset it makes available. Some crypto products and markets are unregulated, and you may not be protected by government compensation and\/or regulatory protection schemes. The unpredictable nature of the cryptoasset markets can lead to loss of funds. Tax may be payable on any return and\/or on any increase in the value of your cryptoassets and you should seek independent advice on your taxation position. Geographic restrictions may apply.<\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p><i>Welcome to a new chapter in competitive trading at Kraken Pro! We&#8217;re excited to roll out our Futures Leaderboard, a fresh community feature ranking our most skilled futures traders. Leaderboard is evidence of your strategy, skill and trading success.<\/i><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":24452,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to