taxes in 2024: fast facts - Kraken Blog\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/industry-news\\\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/industry-news\\\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\\\/\\\/i0.wp.com\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/2023\\\/07\\\/Blog-NEW-Consumer-web-1.png?fit=1535%2C700&ssl=1\",\"datePublished\":\"2024-02-14T14:43:44+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2024-04-10T20:03:51+00:00\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/industry-news\\\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/industry-news\\\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/industry-news\\\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts#primaryimage\",\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/i0.wp.com\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/2023\\\/07\\\/Blog-NEW-Consumer-web-1.png?fit=1535%2C700&ssl=1\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\\/\\\/i0.wp.com\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/2023\\\/07\\\/Blog-NEW-Consumer-web-1.png?fit=1535%2C700&ssl=1\",\"width\":1535,\"height\":700},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/industry-news\\\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"U.S. crypto taxes in 2024: fast facts\"}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#website\",\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/\",\"name\":\"Kraken Blog\",\"description\":\"\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/?s={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValueSpecification\",\"valueRequired\":true,\"valueName\":\"search_term_string\"}}],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#organization\",\"name\":\"Kraken Blog\",\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#\\\/schema\\\/logo\\\/image\\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/i0.wp.com\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/2024\\\/06\\\/New-Lockups%402x.png?fit=214%2C64&ssl=1\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\\/\\\/i0.wp.com\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/2024\\\/06\\\/New-Lockups%402x.png?fit=214%2C64&ssl=1\",\"width\":214,\"height\":64,\"caption\":\"Kraken Blog\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#\\\/schema\\\/logo\\\/image\\\/\"}},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#\\\/schema\\\/person\\\/87e55a5e8ea020a6e620192589a05abf\",\"name\":\"KrakenFX\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/secure.gravatar.com\\\/avatar\\\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g\",\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/secure.gravatar.com\\\/avatar\\\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\\/\\\/secure.gravatar.com\\\/avatar\\\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g\",\"caption\":\"KrakenFX\"},\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/author\\\/alex-hatch\"}]}<\/script>\n<!-- \/ Yoast SEO Premium plugin. -->","yoast_head_json":{"title":"U.S. crypto taxes in 2024: fast facts - Kraken Blog","robots":{"index":"index","follow":"follow","max-snippet":"max-snippet:-1","max-image-preview":"max-image-preview:large","max-video-preview":"max-video-preview:-1"},"canonical":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts","og_locale":"en_US","og_type":"article","og_title":"U.S. crypto taxes in 2024: fast facts","og_description":"IRS tax season is officially open in the United States. April 15, 2024 is the deadline for crypto holders to report their 2023 transactions to the Internal Revenue Service (IRS). The 2023 tax year includes any activity between January 1, 2023 and December 31, 2023. Late filings, failure to pay taxes owed and crypto tax [&hellip;]","og_url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts","og_site_name":"Kraken Blog","article_published_time":"2024-02-14T14:43:44+00:00","article_modified_time":"2024-04-10T20:03:51+00:00","og_image":[{"width":1535,"height":700,"url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Blog-NEW-Consumer-web-1.png","type":"image\/png"}],"author":"KrakenFX","twitter_card":"summary_large_image","twitter_misc":{"Written by":"KrakenFX","Est. reading time":"11 minutes"},"schema":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Article","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts#article","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts"},"author":{"name":"KrakenFX","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/person\/87e55a5e8ea020a6e620192589a05abf"},"headline":"U.S. crypto taxes in 2024: fast facts","datePublished":"2024-02-14T14:43:44+00:00","dateModified":"2024-04-10T20:03:51+00:00","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts"},"wordCount":2374,"commentCount":0,"publisher":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#organization"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Blog-NEW-Consumer-web-1.png?fit=1535%2C700&ssl=1","keywords":["featured","trading"],"articleSection":["Crypto Education","Industry News"],"inLanguage":"en-US","potentialAction":[{"@type":"CommentAction","name":"Comment","target":["https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts#respond"]}]},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts","url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts","name":"U.S. crypto taxes in 2024: fast facts - Kraken Blog","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts#primaryimage"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Blog-NEW-Consumer-web-1.png?fit=1535%2C700&ssl=1","datePublished":"2024-02-14T14:43:44+00:00","dateModified":"2024-04-10T20:03:51+00:00","breadcrumb":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts#breadcrumb"},"inLanguage":"en-US","potentialAction":[{"@type":"ReadAction","target":["https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts"]}]},{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/u-s-crypto-taxes-in-2024-fast-facts#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Blog-NEW-Consumer-web-1.png?fit=1535%2C700&ssl=1","contentUrl":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Blog-NEW-Consumer-web-1.png?fit=1535%2C700&ssl=1","width":1535,"height":700},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@