le":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=24679"}],"version-history":[{"count":11,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/24679\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":24692,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/24679\/revisions\/24692"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/24681"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=24679"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=24679"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=24679"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=24679"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":24629,"date":"2024-03-11T09:00:04","date_gmt":"2024-03-11T13:00:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=24629"},"modified":"2024-03-11T09:00:06","modified_gmt":"2024-03-11T13:00:06","slug":"2024-williams-grid-pass-perks","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/nft\/2024-williams-grid-pass-perks","title":{"rendered":"Explore the perks of owning a 2024 Williams Racing Collectibles+ Grid Pass"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-collect-your-free-pass-and-unlock-immediate-exclusive-digital-and-physical-perks-plus-access-to-unique-williams-racing-experiences-powered-by-kraken\">Collect your free pass and unlock immediate, exclusive digital and physical perks plus access to unique Williams Racing experiences, powered by Kraken.<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In October 2023, we launched the <a href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/nft\/introducing-the-ultimate-free-fan-engagement-experience-williams-racing-collectibles-grid-pass\">free Grid Pass in collaboration with Williams Racing<\/a>. Since then, over 50,000 clients have claimed a Grid Pass and put it to work. They gained exclusive access to special perks like Fan Zone activities, new merchandise pre-sales and free digital collectible airdrops (that some fans have sold!).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In 2024, the Grid Pass has a fresh new look and will be offering a whole lot more perks including:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>A 15% discount on Williams Racing merch<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Exclusive access to special activities at Williams Racing Fan Zones<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Multiple digital collectibles<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>More fun surprises we\u2019ll announce throughout the year!<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"254\" data-attachment-id=\"24639\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/nft\/2024-williams-grid-pass-perks\/attachment\/williamsimage3\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/williamsimage3.png?fit=1999%2C496&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1999,496\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"williamsimage3\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/williamsimage3.png?fit=1024%2C254&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/williamsimage3.png?resize=1024%2C254&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24639\" style=\"width:839px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/williamsimage3.png?resize=1024%2C254&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/williamsimage3.png?resize=300%2C74&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/williamsimage3.png?resize=768%2C191&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/williamsimage3.png?resize=1536%2C381&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/williamsimage3.png?resize=1200%2C298&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/williamsimage3.png?resize=200%2C50&amp;ssl=1 200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/williamsimage3.png?w=1999&amp;ssl=1 1999w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you already have a Grid Pass there is nothing you need to do (except tell your friends who don\u2019t have one!). Your Grid Pass design has been automatically updated to the 2024 livery.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>If you don\u2019t yet have a Grid Pass, <a href=\"https:\/\/nft.kraken.com\/williams-grid-pass\">what are you waiting for<\/a>?! They are free<\/strong> (limited to one per Kraken client).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Eligibility:<\/strong> The Grid Pass is available in most countries around the world. To unlock all Grid Pass perks, holders will also need to create a Williams Racing account <a href=\"http:\/\/williamsf1.com\/grid-pass\">here<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For full terms, conditions and eligibility requirements, click <a href=\"https:\/\/www.williamsf1.com\/grid-pass\/terms-and-conditions\">here<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Claiming a Grid Pass is instant, free, and it immediately appears in your account. Here&#8217;s a step-by-step video walkthrough: <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video aligncenter wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-videopress\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe title=\"VideoPress Video Player\" aria-label='VideoPress Video Player' width='500' height='281' src='https:\/\/videopress.com\/embed\/luYXmK7Y?cover=1&amp;preloadContent=metadata&amp;useAverageColor=1&amp;hd=0' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen data-resize-to-parent=\"true\" allow='clipboard-write'><\/iframe><script src='https:\/\/v0.wordpress.com\/js\/next\/videopress-iframe.js?m=1674852142'><\/script>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/nft.kraken.com\/williams-grid-pass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claim your free Grid Pass<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-putting-your-grid-pass-to-work\">Putting your Grid Pass to work<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here are just some of the perks for Grid Pass holders this year:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>February&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>New Grid Pass design with updated FW46 livery<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>March&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Australia Fan Zone special experiences<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Limited-Edition Heritage Digital Collectibles<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>April<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>New Merch pre-sale access<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"584\" data-attachment-id=\"24659\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/nft\/2024-williams-grid-pass-perks\/attachment\/image4-4\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/image4.png?fit=1760%2C1004&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1760,1004\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"image4\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/image4.png?fit=1024%2C584&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/image4.png?resize=1024%2C584&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24659\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/image4.png?resize=1024%2C584&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/image4.png?resize=300%2C171&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/image4.png?resize=768%2C438&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/image4.png?resize=1536%2C876&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/image4.png?resize=1200%2C685&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/image4.png?resize=175%2C100&amp;ssl=1 175w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/image4.png?w=1760&amp;ssl=1 1760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/nft.kraken.com\/williams-grid-pass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claim your free Grid Pass<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-faq\">FAQ<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>How do I claim my Grid Pass?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>To claim your Grid Pass, visit <a href=\"https:\/\/nft.kraken.com\/williams-grid-pass\">www.nft.kraken.com\/williams-grid-pass<\/a>. You will need a Kraken account to claim your Grid Pass. If you don\u2019t have one you can create a Kraken account in less than a minute. Once signed in, click the button to claim your pass. Claiming is instant and free.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Note: To unlock all the perks of the Grid Pass, holders will also need to create a Williams Racing account <\/em><a href=\"http:\/\/williamsf1.com\/grid-pass\"><em>here<\/em><\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>What can I do with my Grid Pass?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The Grid Pass is your key to all of the benefits and experiences of the Williams Racing Collectibles+ program. These include live and digital experiences with Williams Racing, chances to win race tickets, discounts and early access to merchandise and giveaways. Grid Pass also unlocks digital drops, access to limited edition digital collectibles and proof of attendance mementos. To be eligible to make use of the benefits of the Grid Pass, it must be held in your Kraken account.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>How much does a Grid Pass cost?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Claiming a Grid Pass is <strong>completely free!<\/strong> Just create a free Kraken account and <a href=\"https:\/\/nft.kraken.com\/williams-grid-pass\"><strong>click here<\/strong><\/a> to claim your Grid Pass.<br><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>How many Grid Passes will be available?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The 2024 Grid Pass collection will be available to anyone that wants one.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Can I transfer my Grid Pass to another wallet?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Yes, you can transfer your Grid Pass to your own Web3 wallet. Initially, your Grid Pass should stay in your Kraken account to receive the first batch of perks and rewards.<br><br>In the next few months, you will be able to connect your Web3 wallet to the Williams Racing site directly to unlock future benefits, if you choose to withdraw your Grid Pass to your wallet. Keeping your Grid Pass in your Kraken account is up to you, but it will make accessing some perks and rewards faster and easier.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Can I lose my Grid Pass?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>As long as the Grid Pass is held in your Kraken account, it cannot be lost.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>These materials are for general information purposes only and are not investment advice or a recommendation or solicitation to buy, sell, stake or hold any crypto asset or to engage in any specific trading strategy. Kraken does not and will not work to increase or decrease the price of any particular crypto asset it makes available. Some crypto products and markets are unregulated, and you may not be protected by government compensation and\/or regulatory protection schemes. The unpredictable nature of the crypto asset markets can lead to loss of funds. Tax may be payable on any return and\/or on any increase in the value of your crypto assets and you should seek independent advice on your taxation position. Geographic restrictions may apply.<\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p><I>Kraken, the Official Crypto and Web3 Partner of Williams Racing, is excited to announce the 2024 roadmap for the <b>Williams Racing Collectibles+ Grid Pass, powered by Kraken.<\/b><\/I><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":24631,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1460],"tags":[1403,1421,1815],"language":[],"class_list":["post-24629","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-nft","tag-kraken","tag-nft","tag-williams-racing"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Explore the perks of owning a 2024 Williams Racing Collectibles+ Grid Pass - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/nft\/2024-williams-grid-pass-perks\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta 