"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/24731\/revisions\/24738"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/24732"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=24731"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=24731"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=24731"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=24731"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":24751,"date":"2024-03-20T10:21:31","date_gmt":"2024-03-20T14:21:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=24751"},"modified":"2024-03-22T08:50:23","modified_gmt":"2024-03-22T12:50:23","slug":"new-analytics-widgets-on-kraken-pro-elevate-your-trading-strategy","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/new-analytics-widgets-on-kraken-pro-elevate-your-trading-strategy","title":{"rendered":"New analytics widgets on Kraken Pro: Elevate your trading strategy"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These widgets not only offer advanced analytics for both spot and futures markets, they also seamlessly integrate with existing Trade and Portfolio widgets. Open up new avenues for discovering opportunities and finding alpha; enhance your trading like never before.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/trade\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Add analytics to your Kraken Pro layout<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-introducing-advanced-analytics-for-spot-and-futures-markets\">Introducing advanced analytics for spot and futures markets<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our commitment to your trading experience brings you a suite of widgets catering to a wide array of analytical needs. Whether you&#8217;re looking to gauge market sentiment with the Aggressor Ratio, monitor market activity through Trade Count or make informed investment decisions with Volatility and Volume, our latest additions provide comprehensive market data at your fingertips.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-spot-and-futures-markets-insights\">Spot and futures markets insights<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"572\" data-attachment-id=\"24761\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/new-analytics-widgets-on-kraken-pro-elevate-your-trading-strategy\/attachment\/spot-analytics-widgets\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Spot-Analytics-Widgets.png?fit=3594%2C2008&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"3594,2008\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Spot-Analytics-Widgets\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Spot-Analytics-Widgets.png?fit=1024%2C572&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Spot-Analytics-Widgets.png?resize=1024%2C572&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24761\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Spot-Analytics-Widgets.png?resize=1024%2C572&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Spot-Analytics-Widgets.png?resize=300%2C168&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Spot-Analytics-Widgets.png?resize=768%2C429&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Spot-Analytics-Widgets.png?resize=1536%2C858&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Spot-Analytics-Widgets.png?resize=2048%2C1144&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Spot-Analytics-Widgets.png?resize=1200%2C670&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Spot-Analytics-Widgets.png?resize=179%2C100&amp;ssl=1 179w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Spot-Analytics-Widgets.png?w=3000&amp;ssl=1 3000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-available-spot-widgets-include\">Available spot widgets include:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Aggressor Ratio:<\/strong> Delve into the taker buy vs. taker sell imbalance in your selected market<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Trade Count:<\/strong> Keep tabs on the number of trades within your chosen period<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Volatility:<\/strong> Gauge market volatility through rolling volatility metrics<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Volume:<\/strong> Assess market liquidity with detailed trading volumes<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Order Book analytics:<\/strong> Analyze bid\/ask volume imbalances and explore potential slippage scenarios<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-futures-markets-exclusives\">Futures markets exclusives<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"549\" data-attachment-id=\"24763\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/new-analytics-widgets-on-kraken-pro-elevate-your-trading-strategy\/attachment\/futures-analytics-widgets\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Futures-analytics-widgets.png?fit=3594%2C1926&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"3594,1926\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Futures-analytics-widgets\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Futures-analytics-widgets.png?fit=1024%2C549&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Futures-analytics-widgets.png?resize=1024%2C549&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24763\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Futures-analytics-widgets.png?resize=1024%2C549&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Futures-analytics-widgets.png?resize=300%2C161&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Futures-analytics-widgets.png?resize=768%2C412&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Futures-analytics-widgets.png?resize=1536%2C823&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Futures-analytics-widgets.png?resize=2048%2C1098&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Futures-analytics-widgets.png?resize=1200%2C643&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Futures-analytics-widgets.png?resize=187%2C100&amp;ssl=1 187w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Futures-analytics-widgets.png?w=3000&amp;ssl=1 3000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-futures-widgets-include\">Futures widgets include:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Funding Rate: <\/strong>Get hourly updates on the estimated funding rate to stay ahead<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Open Interest:<\/strong> Monitor the market&#8217;s total number of contracts<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Futures Premium:<\/strong> Investigate the futures basis for strategic insights<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Spread:<\/strong> Observe the top of the book spread for optimal bid and ask prices<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Long\/Short Ratio:<\/strong> Gain market positioning insights with the long\/short ratio<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Liquidation Volume:<\/strong> Track liquidations to understand market dynamics and risk<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-real-time-updates-and-customizable-views\">Real-time updates and customizable views<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Tailor your analytics view to your trading strategy with our customizable, real-time-updating widgets. With flexibility to drag, drop and resize \u2013 along with period selectors from one minute to one week \u2013 these widgets integrate seamlessly into your <a href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/create-custom-layouts-on-kraken-pro\">custom trading layout<\/a>. They dynamically update with your selected market, ensuring data relevance and timeliness.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-examples-of-bespoke-layouts-for-various-trading-strategies\">Examples of bespoke layouts for various trading strategies<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-day-trading\"><strong>Day Trading<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"547\" data-attachment-id=\"24765\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/new-analytics-widgets-on-kraken-pro-elevate-your-trading-strategy\/attachment\/day-trader\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Day-Trader.png?fit=3594%2C1920&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"3594,1920\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Day-Trader\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Day-Trader.png?fit=1024%2C547&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Day-Trader.png?resize=1024%2C547&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24765\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Day-Trader.png?resize=1024%2C547&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Day-Trader.png?resize=300%2C160&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Day-Trader.png?resize=768%2C410&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Day-Trader.png?resize=1536%2C821&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Day-Trader.png?resize=2048%2C1094&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Day-Trader.png?resize=1200%2C641&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Day-Trader.png?resize=187%2C100&amp;ssl=1 187w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Day-Trader.png?w=3000&amp;ssl=1 3000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Combine the Volume and Volatility widgets with Market Chart, Order Book and Order Forms for a layout that offers quick insights into market movements. Add Trade Count to monitor intraday high-frequency trading activity levels.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:13px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-swing-trading\"><strong>Swing Trading<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"547\" data-attachment-id=\"24767\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/new-analytics-widgets-on-kraken-pro-elevate-your-trading-strategy\/attachment\/swing-trader\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Swing-Trader.png?fit=3596%2C1922&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"3596,1922\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Swing-Trader\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Swing-Trader.png?fit=1024%2C547&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Swing-Trader.png?resize=1024%2C547&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24767\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Swing-Trader.png?resize=1024%2C547&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Swing-Trader.png?resize=300%2C160&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Swing-Trader.png?resize=768%2C410&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Swing-Trader.png?resize=1536%2C821&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Swing-Trader.png?resize=2048%2C1095&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Swing-Trader.png?resize=1200%2C641&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Swing-Trader.png?resize=187%2C100&amp;ssl=1 187w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Swing-Trader.png?w=3000&amp;ssl=1 3000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For those focusing on medium-term strategies, integrating Aggressor Ratio and Futures Premium widgets with a Depth Chart and Price Alerts can provide a deeper understanding of market sentiment and potential price breakouts.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:14px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-arbitrage-trading\"><strong>Arbitrage Trading<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"546\" data-attachment-id=\"24769\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/new-analytics-widgets-on-kraken-pro-elevate-your-trading-strategy\/attachment\/arbitrage-trader\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Arbitrage-Trader.png?fit=3600%2C1918&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"3600,1918\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Arbitrage-Trader\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Arbitrage-Trader.png?fit=1024%2C546&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Arbitrage-Trader.png?resize=1024%2C546&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24769\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Arbitrage-Trader.png?resize=1024%2C546&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Arbitrage-Trader.png?resize=300%2C160&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Arbitrage-Trader.png?resize=768%2C409&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Arbitrage-Trader.png?resize=1536%2C818&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Arbitrage-Trader.png?resize=2048%2C1091&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Arbitrage-Trader.png?resize=1200%2C639&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Arbitrage-Trader.png?resize=188%2C100&amp;ssl=1 188w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Arbitrage-Trader.png?w=3000&amp;ssl=1 3000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Traders looking for arbitrage opportunities might find a layout combining Spread (for futures markets), Order Book Analytics and Volume widgets invaluable. These can be used alongside Market Chart and Order Forms to quickly spot and act on price discrepancies between markets or pairs.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:14px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-risk-manager\"><strong>Risk Manager<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"546\" data-attachment-id=\"24774\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/new-analytics-widgets-on-kraken-pro-elevate-your-trading-strategy\/attachment\/risk-manager\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Risk-manager.png?fit=3594%2C1916&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"3594,1916\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Risk-manager\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Risk-manager.png?fit=1024%2C546&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Risk-manager.png?resize=1024%2C546&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24774\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Risk-manager.png?resize=1024%2C546&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Risk-manager.png?resize=300%2C160&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Risk-manager.png?resize=768%2C409&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Risk-manager.png?resize=1536%2C819&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Risk-manager.png?resize=2048%2C1092&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Risk-manager.png?resize=1200%2C640&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Risk-manager.png?resize=188%2C100&amp;ssl=1 188w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Risk-manager.png?w=3000&amp;ssl=1 3000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Incorporating Liquidation Volume and Long\/Short Ratio widgets with Funding Rate and Open Interest allows clients to assess market risk and leverage positions more effectively. Pair these with Price Alerts and Order Book to maintain a close watch on your trades and market conditions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-unlocking-new-strategies-with-integrated-analytics\">Unlocking new strategies with integrated analytics<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By integrating the new analytics widgets with Kraken Pro&#8217;s <a href=\"http:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/trade\/btc-usd#dialog\/add-new-layout\">customizable layout tools<\/a>, clients can unlock a plethora of trading strategies tailored to both spot and futures markets. This cohesive approach not only enriches your trading experience but also equips you with the insights needed to navigate the crypto markets with confidence and precision.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Explore new possibilities, customize your interface and leverage these powerful tools to enhance your trading strategy!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/trade\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Add analytics to your Kraken Pro layout<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>These materials are for general information purposes only and are not investment advice or a recommendation or solicitation to buy, sell, stake or hold any cryptoasset or to engage in any specific trading strategy. Kraken will not undertake efforts to increase the value of any cryptoasset that you buy. Some crypto products and markets are unregulated, and you may not be protected by government compensation and\/or regulatory protection schemes. The unpredictable nature of the crypto-asset markets can lead to loss of funds. Tax may be payable on any return and\/or on any increase in the value of your cryptoassets and you should seek independent advice on your taxation position. Geographic restrictions may apply.<\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p><i>In the ever-evolving world of crypto trading, staying ahead requires having the right tools at your disposal. Kraken Pro is thrilled to unveil 11 new analytics layout widgets, designed to enrich your trading interface with deeper market insights.<\/i><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":24755,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_ne